In recognition of the vital role played by the healthcare, emerging sciences, and technologysectors L fostering the overall gro*'th a:rd development of Pakistan, it is essential to establisha dedicated institutign of higher leaming that addresses the evolving demands of thesecritical fields. The es]ablishment of the National University of Health, Emerging Sciences,and Technologies Q'IUHEST) aims to be a transformative step towards enhancing thenation's capacity in healthcare, research, and technology-driven innovations.NUHEST willserve as a hub for cutting-edge research and innovation in emerging sciences andtechnologies.The university will bridge the knowledge gap, fostering expertise in emergingareas. Thl establishrnent of NUHEST aims to nurture a skilled and empowered workforce,capable of driving Pakistan's progress in healthcare and technology. Through comprehensivetraining, .-.", d"u#op-ent opportunities, and leadership programs, the university willproduce professionals who can positively impact the nation's socio-economicdevelopment.The creation of NUF{EST aligns with the national agenda of elevating thestandard of higher education in Pakistan. so, the National University of Health, EmergingSciences, and Technologies Act seeks to establish a forward-thinking institution that willplay a pivotal role in.shaping the future of healthcare, research, and technology in Pakistal.The establishment ;f NUHEST is an essential step towards fostering a healthier,technologically advarifed, and prosperous nation.-. sd/-tflE,-T,Lr HtQ + p I eAni[nZt p;,Member National tusemblY
